Supplementary data 1. Resulting database from our systematic search on the developmental plasticity in insect reproductive morphology. This search was conducted on September 21, 2024. We used both the Web of Science and Scopus databases. Raw search was manually filtered to match our criteria (see manuscript for details): studies should necessarily include two features - 1) variation in the morphology of a reproductive trait and 2) an associated environmental condition. Note that studies that examined more than one reproductive trait, different measurements of the same reproductive structure, or the influence of different environmental conditions, may have multiple entries.
